{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/","title":"요의 EX-B6","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 요의의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"요의 EX-B6\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-B6\n위치\n등의 척주부위(vertebral region), 넷째 허리뼈(the 4th lumbar vertebra)의 가시돌기(spinous process) 아래에서 가쪽 3寸 부위.\n취혈\n腰陽關(GV3) 가쪽 3寸에서 취혈한다. 大腸兪(BL25)와 같은 높이에 있다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.3～1寸\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-B6","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_2","text":"등의 척주부위(vertebral region), 넷째 허리뼈(the 4th lumbar vertebra)의 가시돌기(spinous process) 아래에서 가쪽 3寸 부위.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_3","text":"腰陽關(GV3) 가쪽 3寸에서 취혈한다. 大腸兪(BL25)와 같은 높이에 있다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_4","text":"直刺 0.3～1寸","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-0CEEA0B839E63CF4","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b6/","text_sha256":"9dfb115ac87eeaa21b58c69621874293e4230c44e40cc60a0b522c23687af452","source_sha256":"0334a003e22e67241bf6dcaa915efeada4b64d3ff7cb903e9b5829e1cabfb7d0","commit":"26c192ae03b3b873f2de5e152533e89a73e44992"}}
